<title>USA: Zila acquires Bio-Dental Technologies.</title>
<headline>Zila acquires Bio-Dental Technologies.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zila Inc said on Wednesday it had completed the acquisition of Bio-Dental Technologies Corp .</p>
<p>Zila, an oral healthcare products marketer, said it completed the acquisition after Bio-Dental's shareholders approved the all-stock transaction on December 30.</p>
<p>It said it will give Bio-Dental shareholders 0.825 shares of Zila stock for each share of Bio-Dental stock.</p>
<p>The acquisition will increase Zila's annual revenue from $6.8 million to an estimated $40.0 million, it said.</p>
<p>Bio-Dental's revenues grew to $33.0 million from $2.7 million in 1991 last year, it said.</p>
